      "id": "claim_e2be19d418cd4af48335b26854a8fd02",
      "statement": "The integration suite boots the real workshop-backend and real gatekeepers under wrangler's createTestHarness and speaks Cap'n Web over a WebSocket to /api — the same transport the browser uses; nothing is stubbed except outbound HTTP, so the code under test runs in another process (workerd), which shapes the whole design.",
